# --- Push notifications (Firebase/FCM) ---
# Not a MVP-breaking secret (restricted by package name/SHA, Google's own docs say it's safe
# in a public repo), but kept local anyway, consistent with how .env/service_role are handled
# — each dev/environment registers its own Firebase project rather than sharing one.
google-services.json

